 <h3><u>Mukhtar Zindabad</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya Lisaratil Hussain..(6)</p> 
  <p>Mukhtar, Mukhtar, Mukhtar Zindabaad, Mukhtar Zindabaad!</p> 
  <p>Ai Qasr-e-Inteqaam Ke...<br> Ai Qasr-e-Inteqaam Ke Me'maar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Parcham Pe Ye Hussain Ke Likha Hai Bakhuda,<br> Badla Khuda Ne Lena Hai Qatle Hussain Ka,<br> Yaani Hai Tu Khuda Ka..<br> Yaani Hai Tu Khuda Ka Madadgaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Haasil Use Bhi Baap Ke Jaisa Kamaal Hai<br> Taakat Tumhari Maalik-e-Ashtar Ka Laal Hai<br> Kya Muntakhib Kiya Hai...<br> Kya Muntakhib Kiya Hai Alamdaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>3. Cheda Nahi Ushe Jo Azadaar Mil Gaya<br> Chhoda Nahi Jo Sheh Ka Gunahagaar Mil Gaya<br> Aisa Hi Hona Chahiye...<br> Aisa Hi Hona Chahiye Kirdaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Shimr O Umar, Tufail, Ibn-e-kahil-e-shaqi<br> Ibn-e-numayr, Ibn-e-anas, Ibn-e-wajibi<br> Chun Chun Ke Tu Ne Maare...<br> Chun Chun Ke Tu Ne Maare Gunahagaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Ghar Ghar Se Aa Rahi Hai Sada Ya Hussain Ki<br> Ab Tak Sadaayen Deti Hai Kufe Ki Har Gali<br> Tu Zindabaad Aur...<br> Tu Zindabaad Aur Teri Sarkaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Munsif Bhi Khud Hai Khud Hi Tu Apna Wakeel Hai<br> Maasoom Ki Khushi Tere Haq Mein Daleel Hai<br> Raazi Hai Tujh Se...<br> Raazi Hai Tujh Se Aabid-e-beemaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Lamhe Nabi Ke Ghar Mein Kuchh Aaye Hain Chain Ke<br> Chun Kar Jo Tu Ne Maare Hain Kaatil Hussain Ke<br> Mismaar Kar Di...<br> Mismaar Kar Di Zulm Ki Deewaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar Zindabaad..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Mukhtar Naama Haq Ki Takallum Hai Daastaan<br> Khoon Mein Naha Ke Kehti Hai Kufe Ki Surkhiya'n<br> Chilla Raha Hai Shaam Ka...<br> Chilla Raha Hai Shaam Ka Akhbaar Zindabaad Zindabaad Zindabaad!</p> 
  <p>Mukhtar, Mukhtar, Mukhtar Zindabaad!<br> Mukhtar, Mukhtar, Mukhtar Zindabaad!</p> 
  <p>Ya Lisaratil Hussain...</p> 
